_ text-editor-rect-intersection Rect
    - a Rect
    - b Rect

Rect(left, top, right - left, bottom - top)

.. left = max(a.x, b.x)
.. top = max(a.y, b.y)
.. right = max(left, (min(a.right, b.right)))
.. bottom = max(top, (min(a.bottom, b.bottom)))

